window.products.push({"id":749250,"name":"Qasic Crystal Acrylic Apothecary Jars with Lids. 4pc Set 20oz and 10oz Bathroom Organization Containers. Cotton Ball Holder, Cotton Swab Qtip Holder, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ahlGlHDCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ Matching Bathroom Canisters Made for Daily Use! Because most families use cotton swabs / q tips, cotton balls and rounds and hairties daily, we thought you might like an attractively matching Q-tip holder, cotton balls jar, hair tie jar and cotton rounds holder that’s also durable for family use! ✅ They Look Like Glass Bathroom Jars, But Without The Cracks! These are drop-proof acrylic apothecary jars with lids (bamboo), but they’re so clear you wouldn’t know it! This crystal clear canister set mimics GLASS q tip holders – But if anyone drops one, there’s no breakage, just a game of pick-up-q-tips! ✅ Petite Jar Also Perfect as a Q Tip Holder! If a cotton swab holder is too short or the lid too deep, then you can't have a neat bunch of q tips! But our 10oz jars are 3.9\" tall, 2.75” wide and 20oz jars 4.1” tall, and 3.6” wide. And with the perfectly fitted lid closed, cottony stacks are always tidy. ✅ Multi-Room, Multifunctional: Not just a clear jar to use as a bathroom organizer! Fill them with crayons, pack them as a hair accessory organizer with favorite scrunchies! It could be a bath salt container set waiting to be filled with 3 different scents. This cute jar set is for just about anything! ✅ Sound Like The 4 Bathroom Containers You Were Looking For? We've packed your 10oz and 20oz bathroom jars with lids set securely so they arrive undamaged (you let us know if there’s an issue) then you can beautify your bathroom organization and storage immediately! Order now from Qasic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ahlGlHDCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qasic","source_asin":"B09SZG9WWN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SZG9WWN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SZG9WWN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":749251,"name":"Johnson Brothers Willow Blue Dinnerware 12-Inch Oval Platter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HXDM94P6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Johnson Brothers has been making fine English tableware for over 100 years. Of its many celebrated and enduring designs, the Willow Blue pattern is one of the best loved and most collected. Each white porcelain piece is handpainted in cobalt blue. This serving platter features intricate ornamental detail around the lip, and a mythic Asian scene--said to tell an age-old love story--with birds, trees, bridges, boats, and pagodas is depicted in the center of the plate. The platter measures 12 by 9-1/4 inches and is dishwasher-, microwave-, and freezer-safe. Willow Blue pieces are elegant yet durable enough for everyday use. They make wonderful gifts: just as each piece itself tells a story, so will the collection of dishes begin to tell a new story as it grows and is handed down for generations to come. --Erin Brown","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HXDM94P6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Johnson Brothers","source_asin":"B00005097U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005097U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005097U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
