window.products.push({"id":749413,"name":"YHOSSEUN 3 Tier Serving Stand Tiered Serving Stand With 3 Porcelain Serving Platters Trays For Dessert Server Display Collapsible Sturdier Metal Rack ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G9jpiNpPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PERFECT DESIGN: Compare other serving stand,our 3 tier serving stand is redesigned with stronger metal rack which allowing the porcelain platters to lock tightly into the frame. The sturdy frame avoid the serving stand from wobbling or shaking which provider more balance and stability. VERSATILE PRESENTATION SERVING STAND: These serving dishes and platters have a lip all around the edge to avoid food runaway.The serving platters could be great for appetizers, taco,snack,fruits or cheese or other desserts.Porcelain plates could be used separately as serving trays.This 3 tier serving tray would be perfect for any kind of event ,baby showers, birthdays, weddings,parties. PROFESSIONAL FOOD GRADE PORCELAIN: Made of premium white ceramic which is processed at a high temperature giving the trays an elegant texture. Microwave/ Oven/ Dishwasher/ refrigerator safe. The serving metal stand can be hand-wash only. The large 14 inches porcelain platters can enough for hold a variety of food! They also could be separately used as serving trays for daily use. EASY ASSEMBLY AND STORAGE: Set up takes seconds with no tools required!The assembled tiered serving stand measures 14\" x 15.74\" x 9.17\". The swivel feature allows the user to display serving trays in several different ways, whenever you're setting out food for people to grab easily without taking up a ton of table space. The serving platters are stackable and serving stand can take part that will more easily for compact storage anywhere. IDEAL FOR GIFT: The 3-tiered display stand is perfect combination of simple style and versatility. We also offer the good packing.This tier serving stand can be as a wonderful gift for your friends or family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G9jpiNpPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YHOSSEUN","source_asin":"B095NQP16J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095NQP16J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095NQP16J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
