window.products.push({"id":749455,"name":"FLET Tumbler with Stainless Steel Ice Stick | Magnetic Cooling Chiller Stick For Cold Drinks | Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Mug 24 oz Simple Desig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-hNOjafmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"About Flet Tumbler We found the boringness of our favorite drinks diluted by ice during the day. To keep the original taste, FLET tumbler is the answer. FLET and fresh are homophones. Our conceptual design is based on the original freshness of the drinks. The brand logo represents the minimal design of the tumbler shape with FLET stick. FLET stick inspiration came from the woodwind musical instrument. With FLET, you’ll reach a new experience of your drinks like a classical flute playing around you in every single sip. Why FLET Tumbler? There are many times our favorite drinks are not cold enough. You have to add ice so it makes your drink taste bad. There are several times the ice is melted down to our favorite cold drinks so it dilutes our beverages. Some ice we get from the refrigerator or restaurants is not hygienic enough so it gets you diarrhea. Are you tired and bored of these problems? Based on these problems, we invented the FLET Tumbler for you. We designed the FLET tumbler, cooling stick and the case of the stick for our users. The tumbler is designed for those who would love to enjoy your cold drinks throughout the day. The cooling stick is designed to replace the ice without diluting your drinks. It can be attached to the tumbler with magnetic force to keep your favorite drink effectively cool, clean and without losing the flavor of your drinks. 1 Set of FLET Tumbler includes: 1 FLET tumbler 1 FLET cooling stick 1 Straw 1 Cleaning brush’s straw","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-hNOjafmL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flet Tumbler","source_asin":"B08WWMXYY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WWMXYY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WWMXYY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
