window.products.push({"id":749766,"name":"Veracco Being Your Favorite Child Seems Like Gift Enough But Here's A Mug White Ceramic Coffee Mug Funny Mother's Father's Day Birthday Gifts For Dad ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BylFoXU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Veracco Coffee Mug is designed to bring a unique style to your family table and events, keeping your conversations happy. Made of safe ceramic, it is both dishwasher and microwave safe. The mug features a white color and incorporates the stress-reducing effects of the earth. Veracco's quality craftsmanship ensures dependable reliability for frequent, everyday use, making it a go-to kitchen accessory in every cabinet. The mug is a classic white milk glaze with a glossy white handle and hand-applied designs on both sides that can never come off. With its premium stoneware material and twice kiln-fired construction, the Veracco cup set is built to last for years to come. These unique coffee mugs are easy to clean and dishwasher safe, with designs sealed onto the ceramic to prevent fading. These big coffee mugs feature unique feel-good prints that positively jump-start the day or end the night. Each espresso cup holds 11 ounces of your favorite brew, hot chocolate, or tea. Make your loved ones laugh every day with this funny coffee mug, which reminds them that you love them. It is a great gift for women and men, and perfect for birthdays, graduations, parties, or any occasion where happy little chuckles are appropriate. The Veracco reusable Coffee Mug is carefully designed by experts to remind you to slow down and enjoy life with a quality product. As you take the day off with small coffee and tea breaks, the energy of the earth will restore the energy you lost. The mug's distinctive design will make your table unique. These Porcelain coffee cups make elegant gifts for your loved ones, including Christmas mugs, Thanksgiving gifts, anniversary, wedding, special gifts for parents, couples, friends, and lovers. The giftable mug set is sure to please anyone in your life, making it a perfect choice for birthdays, retirements, coworker gifts, or housewarming gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BylFoXU1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veracco","source_asin":"B08Y64GVSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y64GVSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y64GVSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
