window.products.push({"id":749843,"name":"Grey Waffle Shower Curtain with Stainless Steel Hooks - Ombre Heavy Duty Fabric Shower Curtains with Waffle Weave, Hotel Quality, Water Repellent Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811pHHWzcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy Duty Fabric - Soft and thick 230GSM fabric feels like cotton to the touch. The weighted design keeps the shower curtain staying in place and resists moving and blowing. Elegant and upscale look easy to update bathroom decor theme. Upgrade Bathroom - Elegant woven pattern, designed after luxury hotel shower curtains, plus the gradient ombre effect of the shower curtain makes your bathroom look more clean and fresh. Instantly upgrades any bath to create a relaxing spa-like environment. Anti-Rust Shower Curtain Hook - Each waffle shower curtain comes with 12 rust-resistant metal grommets at the top and comes with 12 rust-resistant shower curtain hooks to fit most standard-sized bathtubs and showers. Superior quality stitching and construction ensure you will enjoy your shower curtain for years to come. Easy to clean - Machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle; low temperature drying for hassle-free maintenance and keeps it like new; warm ironing as needed; recommended for use with liners, wash once every week to keep it neat and tidy. Tips - Waffle shower curtain can resist water to some degree. Water droplets slip off and dry quickly, but a small amount of water will still soak through. Recommend together with 100% water-proof shower curtain liner and wash it once a week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811pHHWzcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naturoom","source_asin":"B0BF41YQDZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF41YQDZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF41YQDZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":749844,"name":"Calphalon Commercial Nonstick 5-Quart Sauté Pan with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310FAZ69DZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Company's coming and your spouse just told you? Don't panic, Balsamic Chicken to the rescue, quick, easy, delicious and made from ingredients you probably have on hand. Of course you'll want a reliable sautE pan that won't scorch or stick, with quick even heating and a lid for simmering. Don't give clean up another thought, a simple washing will have it spotless in no time. Amazon.com Calphalon Commercial pans are made for the serious cook who's looking for kitchenware built to last a lifetime. For example, this straight-sided, 12-inch diameter, 5-quart sauté pan, with its heavy-gauge aluminum bottom and sides, heats evenly and won't warp under higher heat needed for pan-frying. Use a light hand on the heat dial though to protect the nonstick surface from overheating. Also, use plastic, coated, or wood utensils to protect the finish. The curved cast stainless-steel handle is easy to grip and stay cooler than expected, thanks to V-shaped splits where they meet the pan. There's also a short looped utility handle on the opposite side of the pan for heavy lifting. Unlike pans with plastic or wood handles, the extremely sturdy all-metal construction provides the flexibility to take the pan to the oven to keep food warm until it's ready to serve. Remember to hand wash all Calphalon pans--dishwasher detergents are bad for the finish, and their use voids the lifetime warranty. --Dale Steinke","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/310FAZ69DZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00004SY6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004SY6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004SY6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":749845,"name":"Fatbaby To My Dear Wife Birthday Black Coffee Mug,Best Wedding Anniversary and Engagement Gifts for Wifey from Husband,Valentine's Day,Mother's Day,Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fCtyCLH+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✅VALENTINE’S DAY GIFT: Never forget I love you forever and always is the most touching words for husband from wife. This is a unique valentines day gift for husband. ✅ANNIVERSARY GIFT: The coffee mug for him with soft loving vow is an anniversary gift idea choice. Also, it is a wedding gift to MR. ✅BIRTHDAY GIFT: If you want an amazing birthday gift to husband, the black ceramic coffee mug is the first choice. ✅HIGH QUALITY: 11oz mug with double sides printing in premium quality with year-long no fading color is dishwasher and microwave safe for your convenience. ✅PRESENT PACKAGING: Each mug is carefully packed in a thick cardboard box with golden and gorgeous printing looking to avoid breakage during the transport. It is the great present for birthday, valentine, anniversary, wedding or Christmas day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fCtyCLH+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fatbaby","source_asin":"B08QCL3KQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QCL3KQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QCL3KQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
