window.products.push({"id":749959,"name":"Super Dad - Personalized Father's Day Gift (6\"x8\" Wood Block Mount)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXeqKfTgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A personalized father's day gift for the man of steel and the real superhero in your life! The personalization (bottom line of text) is created as a permanent part of the image and will not look like a stamp or afterthought as it is uniquely adjusted by our designers for perfect alignment. This personalized gift for dad is available framed under glass, as a wooden block mount or a framed canvas. Under Glass: Published on fine art paper and finished under glass in a contoured frame with a brown wood-grain laminate finish. Comes ready to hang and enjoy! Block Mount: Our wood block mount is a contemporary and frame-less way to have your print displayed. The image is professionally laminated and mounted to a 1/2\" thick wooden block to create a smooth and vivid print. Comes ready to hang and enjoy. Canvas: Published as a giclée on fine art canvas and finished in a wood frame with a smooth black laminate finish. Framing is done in-house using acid free archival materials. Canvas prints are coated with a UV resistant spray and like all canvas art it does not require glass. Comes ready to hang and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXeqKfTgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Personal-Prints","source_asin":"B088KMQ1DQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-749959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088KMQ1DQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088KMQ1DQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
